  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The training is intended to be highly participatory, with rich discussion and
much of the learning coming from participants themselves. A variety of training methods will be used in each of the modules including presentations, case studies, plenary discussion, small group work, role plays, mentimeter, jam boards, among others, as well as participant led sessions and interactive exercises. Aim to develop materials in 4 modules for UNHCR staff and partners with learning objectives and activities which reflect what participants would be able to do after completing the activities proposed.</narrative>
